# Local secret for `npx wrangler dev` (run from client/, after `npm run build`).
# Copy this file to client/.dev.vars and paste a Places API (New) key.
# Do not commit .dev.vars. Do not put this key in a REACT_APP_ variable.
GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=

# The Monday report also reads GA4_SA_KEY and RESEND_API_KEY when you trigger
# the cron locally. They are not required for the reviews route or for
# `wrangler deploy`. The usual preview is the Node script, which takes file
# paths and never needs these lines:
#   node scripts/send-report.mjs --example --dry-run --out report.html
